LanguageData.CVG_Tribulation_LetterText:
The breakthrough worked, but Heaven will not let {PAWN_nameDef} reach {1} so easily. Black clouds gather above {PAWN_objective}: a heavenly tribulation is coming.
Lightning bolts: {2} (damage {3} each). Celestial dissonance: {4}. {5}
If {PAWN_pronoun} is still standing when the clouds part, {PAWN_pronoun} will reach {1}.

