LanguageData.CVG_SectsArrive_Text:
Through the rifts of the Convergence, the sects of Jiuxiao have crossed into this world and raised their halls among us:

{0}

Some will trade, some will judge, and one of them hunts. Their goodwill can be earned, and each sect has ranks for those who prove themselves.
